+\vDash_{\Psi,\Phi} G_1\simeq^I_O G_2\ &\stackrel{\mathrm{def}}{=}\
+  \vDash G_1\sim G_2:\ =_I\wedge\Psi\ \Rightarrow\ =_O\wedge\Phi
+\end{aligned}
+$$
